# ~/instagram-api/lab/p3-34/practice1.http
### 새 화면 — keyword
GET http://localhost:4001/api/members/search?keyword=민

### 옛 화면 — q
GET http://localhost:4001/api/members/search?q=민

### 둘 다 보내면 keyword
GET http://localhost:4001/api/members/search?keyword=dahye&q=민

### 검색어 없이
GET http://localhost:4001/api/members/search
